- Build mobile-first, Persian RTL UI compatible with Telegram WebView.
- Respect Telegram theme, viewport and safe-area insets when supported by the SDK.
- Include loading, empty, offline, stale-data and error states.
- Display price unit, source and data timestamp next to every market value.
- Color must not be the only signal indicator; include clear text and icon/label.
- Do not claim Telegram identity is verified without server-side initData validation.
